    {
      "id": "p3",
      "text": "The culmination of a playoff journey for the victorious organization meant advancement at another's expense. Their strategic game execution in Game 4, holding the injury-depleted roster's offense to a single goal, completed the series conclusion. This playoff advancement was the championship series qualification for the NHL team, but it highlighted the vulnerable state of the harmed party's key players sidelined by injury.",
